{"strongs": "H8152", "word": "שִׁנְעָר", "translit": "shin.ar", "root": "שנער", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "Shinar = Babylonia", "definition": "שִׁנְעָר proper name, of a location Shinar = Babylonia (= Babylonian Šumêr according to COT Gen 11:1 and others, > denied by Hal Rev. Crit. 1883, 44 Jen ZK ii(1885), 419 ; Egyptian Sangar ( WMM As.u.Eur.279 ), Tel Amarna Šan—ar ( Wkl TelAm. 25 ) identification with ׳ שׁ by Mey Egyptiaca 63 ; compare, further, Pinches Hast. DB SHINAR ); — ׳ אֶרֶץ שׁ Gen 10:10 ; Gen 11:2 ; Zech 5:11 ; Dan 1:2 ׳ מֶלֶךְשֿׁ (Amraphel) Gen 14:2 ; Gen 14:9 ׳ שׁ alone Isa 11:11 (as place of diaspora); ׳ אַדֶּרֶת שׁ Josh 7:21 ᵐ5 usually Σεν ( ν ) ααρ ; Zech 5:11 ( ἐν γῆ ) Βαβυλῶνος . שְׁנָת sleep , see שֵׁנָה below יָשֵׁן .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8896')\">BDB8896</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8152')\">H8152</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8895')\">BDB8895</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8897')\">BDB8897</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שִׁנְעָר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a location</b> <highlightword>Shinar = Babylonia</highlightword> (= Babylonian <transliteration><highlight>Šumêr</highlight></transliteration> according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('COT')\">COT<sup><ref ref=\"Gen 11:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,1)\">Gen 11:1</ref></sup></lookup> and others, &gt; denied by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>Rev. Crit. 1883, 44</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Jen')\">Jen<sup>ZK ii(1885), 419</sup></lookup>; Egyptian <transliteration><highlight>Sangar</highlight></transliteration> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('WMM')\">WMM<sup>As.u.Eur.279</sup></lookup>), Tel Amarna <transliteration><highlight>Šan—ar</highlight></transliteration> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wkl')\">Wkl<sup>TelAm. 25</sup></lookup>) identification with <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Mey')\">Mey<sup>Egyptiaca 63</sup></lookup>; compare, further, Pinches<sup>Hast. DB SHINAR</sup>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶרֶץ שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 10:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,10)\">Gen 10:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,2)\">Gen 11:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 5:11\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(38,5,11)\">Zech 5:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 1:2\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,2)\">Dan 1:2</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מֶלֶךְשֿׁ</bdbheb> (Amraphel) <ref ref=\"Gen 14:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,2)\">Gen 14:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 14:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,9)\">Gen 14:9</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> alone <ref ref=\"Isa 11:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,11)\">Isa 11:11</ref> (as place of diaspora); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַדֶּרֶת שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 7:21\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,21)\">Josh 7:21</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> usually <grk>Σεν</grk>(<grk>ν</grk>)<grk>ααρ</grk>; <ref ref=\"Zech 5:11\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(38,5,11)\">Zech 5:11</ref> (<grk>ἐν γῆ</grk>) <grk>Βαβυλῶνος</grk>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>שְׁנָת</bdbheb> <highlight>sleep</highlight>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>שֵׁנָה</reflink></bdbheb> below <bdbheb>יָשֵׁן</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 11:1", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 11, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Gen 10:10", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 10, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Gen 11:2", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 11, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Zech 5:11", "book": "ZEC", "chapt